OK, here is a procedure that will let your users access the data. It
requires ADVFS-UTILITIES license, but so do "addvol" and "rmvol".

Server:/# mkfdmn -p 7200 -x 512 -l 1024 /dev/... new_domain
Server:/# mkfset new_domain new
Server:/# clonefset oracle_domain oracle ora_clone
Server:/# mount -t advfs -o ro oracle_domain#ora_clone /clones/oracle
Server:/# mount -t advfs new_domain#new /mnt
Server:/# vdump -0 -f - /clones/oracle | (cd /mnt ; vrestore -x -f -)
Server:/# umount /clones/oracle
Server:/# rmfset -f oracle_domain ora_clone

