I can't find a document on the AlphaServer 300 specifically.  However,
I do have a document on supported Video cards, and there are no ISA
video boards that are listed as supported.  The closest was built-in
video on the 1000.

There was an EISA board supported, the Compaq Qvision 1024/E.  If your
system has EISA slots then you should run the ECU utility to configure
the EISA slots.  Otherwise, there are a number of PCI boards that should
work.

