If the board works at the console level, you might be able to convince
Tru64 to use it as a generic VGA board.  However, it is my experience
that Tru64 is rather selective about the boards it supports.

You should try looking at the Tru64 web page, which should have pointers
to which hardware is supported.  Note that it makes a big difference
which version of Tru64 you are running.  Start at www.tru64unix.compaq.com


