I'm sure the DEC/COMPAQ clustering is great at what it does. I'm glad to
see that it will be added into HP-UX over the next couple of years.

However the term cluster has become over used, and I'm sure that no one
solution is likely to be the perfect match for all the things the word is now
used to mean.


