The DLM provides the mechanisms for coordination, but doesn't coordinate
things itself. THe XQP does coordination for the file system-level stuff,
RMS does it for records in files, and XFC (once it actually works
proporly) for the (distributed) block cache. You (or Oracle or...) can use
it to coordinate activity in your application.

