> > 
> >> > There are no binary configuration files in System V derived
> >> > systems. 
> >> 
> >> Although this is largely true,  it is not completely true.  While
> >> the BSD printing system (LPR) is entirely based on ASCII config
> >files,> regrettably the SysV system (LPD) is not.  This makes it very
